     "step": "method",
     "title": "aₙ = 1/(n(n + 1)): the sum of 99 terms",
     "steps": [
      "Split: 1/(n(n + 1)) = 1/n − 1/(n + 1).",
      "S₉₉ = (1 − 1/2) + (1/2 − 1/3) + … + (1/99 − 1/100).",
